<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lam Research EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lam Research EPS view cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Friday it lowered its fiscal 1997 earnings estimate on Lam Research Corp to $1.15 per share from $1.30 per share.</p>
<p>-- Said reduction reflects potential earnings per share dilution from OnTrack Systems acquisition.</p>
<p>-- Kept rating at outperform.  Said still views earnings upside surprises as a possibility.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-13/16 to 58-1/8.</p>
</text>
